{"title":"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>Ann is delivering newspapers. Two thirds of the way through her deliveries she has delivered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> newspapers. How many newspapers did she deliver in total?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the total number of newspapers. Since she has delivered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> newspapers so far, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the total, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94d8a8d2ae0bad26a08051a3bd32ae7b0d6f73f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3} \\times x = N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/1/21114009cdd06316166fe145601e49801a68d00b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{N}{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\frac{3N}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"111\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">player 1</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e5a121d1ac659b930801d7b07b25eb5d4471c48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/a/8dac5fab817e6ea90b46c5fa8c79f16f34e72a28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{3 \\times 110}{2} = \\frac{330}{2} = \\boxed{165}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"217\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC\">2021 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Relay A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Relay A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEM